{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/spectralgraphtheory\/graphprotocols\/graph\/numberofspanningtrees(as:weight:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of spanning trees τ(G), weighted and exactly: the sum over spanning trees of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"product of their weights, or nil when it is 2¹²⁸ or more. Loops never lie on a tree;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parallel edges each count. 0 for the empty graph and for a disconnected one, 1 for one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"numberOfSpanningTrees","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"as","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"type","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt128","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UInt128V"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt128","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UInt128V"},{"text":"? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BinaryInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sz"}],"languages":["swift"